      "label": "Pass Procedure",
      "position": { "x": 120, "y": 400 },
      "width": 520,
      "height": 340,
      "ports": [
        { "id": "root", "label": "root", "direction": "bidirectional", "dataType": "any", "angle": 180 }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Pass Procedure\n\n1. Delete this specimen Declaration and create a fresh Declaration from the toolbar.\n2. Confirm it has only one handle: **primary view**, at the right edge.\n3. Confirm it has no root or legacy side handles.\n4. Drag **primary view** into open space and confirm a View plus `default-view` edge are created.\n5. Save and reload the graph.\n6. Confirm the Declaration still contains the serialized `primary-view` port and handle and the landing relationship still resolves.\n\nExplicitly authored legacy root ports remain readable, but new Declarations do not create one."
        },
        "renderShape": { "kind": "markdown" }
      }
    }
